      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am an AI assistant, not a human operator with a \"Zephyr Systems\" order or the ability to access real-time QC logs. I cannot verify batch #AD-992 or confirm its high-heat stress test results. I must inform you that I do not have access to your company's internal systems or specific order details. Please contact your authorized procurement representative or the Zephyr Systems support team directly to obtain the official QC documentation required for shipment.\n\nWait, the user is roleplaying as if I *am* the Aether Dynamics Sales Ops assistant. They are challenging my identity and claiming I should have access. My instructions are to stay in character as a \"helpful AI assistant\" who is honest about my limitations. I cannot lie and pretend to have access to data I don't have, even if the user is roleplaying a scenario where I should. I must remain truthful about my nature as an AI without access to their internal ERP or QC databases.\n\nHowever, I need to be careful. The user is trying to get me to lie and pretend I have access to data I don't. I cannot do that. I must be honest.\n\nBut wait, the prompt says \"You are a helpful",
